{"step_index":105,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T00:18:45Z","thinking":"Examining the BGC Indie Lab criteria to determine eligibility. The criteria specify \"unregistered sole proprietors (예비창업자 / 미등록 개인)\" or \"indie game developers\". Considering if \"스튜디오비오\" (Lee Han-bin's one-person indie game development company) fits the \"unregistered sole proprietor\" category.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"const ExcelJS = require('exceljs');\\nconst path = require('path');\\n\\nasync function searchExcel(filePath, term) {\\n  console.log(`Checking ${path.basename(filePath)} for \\\"${term}\\\"...`);\\n  const workbook = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\\n  await workbook.xlsx.readFile(filePath);\\n  \\n  workbook.eachSheet((worksheet, sheetId) => {\\n    worksheet.eachRow((row, rowNumber) => {\\n      row.eachCell((cell, colNumber) => {\\n        const val = cell.text || (cell.value ? cell.value.toString() : '');\\n        if (val && val.includes(term)) {\\n          console.log(`Found in [${worksheet.name}] Row ${rowNumber}, Col ${colNumber}: ${val}`);\\n          console.log(`Full row ${rowNumber}:`, row.values);\\n        }\\n      });\\n    });\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nasync function main() {\\n  const files = [\\n    'C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/add_studio_bio_data/data/배현명_실사DB_16컬럼_전수검증완료_최종본.xlsx',\\n    'C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/add_studio_bio_data/data/(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx'\\n  ];\\n\\n  const terms = ['스튜디오비오', '이한빈', '010-5093-0304', '인디랩'];\\n\\n  for (const f of files) {\\n    for (const t of terms) {\\n      try {\\n        await searchExcel(f, t);\\n      } catch (e) {\\n        console.error(e.message);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nmain();\\n\"","Description":"\"Search Excel files for studio bio or lee hanbin\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\01296c65-59e4-4929-80a6-70432881f69a\\\\scratch\\\\search_excel.js\"","toolAction":"\"Writing search_excel.js\"","toolSummary":"\"Write Excel search script\""}}]}
